   "html": "<div class=\"problem\"><div class=\"p-head\"><span class=\"lvl hard\">压轴</span><span class=\"p-title\">补全：按题意逐字符处理字符串</span></div><div class=\"p-body\"><p>模拟套路。</p><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">for(int i=0;i&lt;s.length();i++)</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  if(___) cnt++;   // 统计某类字符</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">// 答：s[i]==目标字符</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"p-analysis\"><span class=\"label\">▍解析：</span>答：条件填 s[i]==目标字符（或满足题意的判断）；模拟题关键是\"照做不跳步\"。</div></div>",
