   "id": "more",
   "title": "模式四~六：搜索 / 二分 / 并查集",
   "html": "<div class=\"problem\"><div class=\"p-head\"><span class=\"lvl mid\">中档</span><span class=\"p-title\">补全：DFS 遍历（防重复访问）</span></div><div class=\"p-body\"><p>搜索套路。</p><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">void dfs(int u){</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  vis[u]=1;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  for(int v:g[u]) if(___) dfs(v);</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">4</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">}</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">5</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">// 答：!vis[v]</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"p-analysis\"><span class=\"label\">▍解析：</span>答：<code>!vis[v]</code>（未访问才递归，防死循环与重复计数）。</div></div><div class=\"problem\"><div class=\"p-head\"><span class=\"lvl mid\">中档</span><span class=\"p-title\">补全：二分找第一个 ≥ x 的位置</span></div><div class=\"p-body\"><p>二分边界。</p><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">int l=0,r=n;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">while(l&lt;r){</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  int m=l+(r-l)/2;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">4</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  if(a[m]&gt;=x) ___; else l=m+1;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">5</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">}</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">6</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">// 答：r=m</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"p-analysis\"><span class=\"label\">▍解析：</span>答：<code>r=m</code>（满足 a[m]>=x 时收缩右界，循环结束 l==r 为下界）。</div></div><div class=\"problem\"><div class=\"p-head\"><span class=\"lvl hard\">压轴</span><span class=\"p-title\">补全：并查集 find（路径压缩）</span></div><div class=\"p-body\"><p>连通块核心。</p><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">int find(int x){</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  if(fa[x]!=x) fa[x]=___;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  return fa[x];</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">4</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">}</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">5</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">// 答：find(fa[x])</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"p-analysis\"><span class=\"label\">▍解析：</span>答：<code>find(fa[x])</code>（递归找根并压缩路径，把整条链直接挂到根，加速后续查询）。</div></div>",
   "text": "中档 补全：DFS 遍历（防重复访问） 搜索套路。 C++ 复制 1 void dfs(int u){ 2 vis[u]=1; 3 for(int v:g[u]) if(___) dfs(v); 4 } 5 // 答：!vis[v] ▍解析： 答： !vis[v] （未访问才递归，防死循环与重复计数）。 中档 补全：二分找第一个 ≥ x 的位置 二分边界。 C++ 复制 1 int l=0,r=n; 2 while(l<r){ 3 int m=l+(r-l)/2; 4 if(a[m]>=x) ___; else l=m+1; 5 } 6 // 答：r=m ▍解析： 答： r=m （满足 a[m]>=x 时收缩右界，循环结束 l==r 为下界）。 压轴 补全：并查集 find（路径压缩） 连通块核心。 C++ 复制 1 int find(int x){ 2 if(fa[x]!=x) fa[x]=___; 3 return fa[x]; 4 } 5 // 答：find(fa[x]) ▍解析： 答： find(fa[x]) （递归找根并压缩路径，把整条链直接挂到根，加速后续查询）。"
  },
  {
   "id": "more2",
   "title": "模式七~十二：高频进阶",
   "html": "<div class=\"problem\"><div class=\"p-head\"><span class=\"lvl mid\">中档</span><span class=\"p-title\">补全：前缀和递推</span></div><div class=\"p-body\"><p>区间和 O(1) 查询。</p><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">int s[N]={0};</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">for(int i=1;i&lt;=n;i++) s[i]=___;   // 答：s[i-1]+a[i]</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">cout &lt;&lt; s[r]-s[l-1];</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"p-analysis\"><span class=\"label\">▍解析：</span>答：<code>s[i-1]+a[i]</code>（前缀和递推；区间和 = s[r]-s[l-1]）。</div></div><div class=\"problem\"><div class=\"p-head\"><span class=\"lvl mid\">中档</span><span class=\"p-title\">补全：差分数组区间加</span></div><div class=\"p-body\"><p>区间统一加 v。</p><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">for(int i=1;i&lt;=n;i++) d[i]=a[i]-a[i-1];</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">d[l]+=v; ___;   // 答：d[r+1]-=v</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">// 还原：a[i]=a[i-1]+d[i]</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"p-analysis\"><span class=\"label\">▍解析：</span>答：<code>d[r+1]-=v</code>（差分区间加只改两端，最后前缀和还原）。</div></div><div class=\"problem\"><div class=\"p-head\"><span class=\"lvl hard\">压轴</span><span class=\"p-title\">补全：单调栈求下一个更大元素</span></div><div class=\"p-body\"><p>Next Greater。</p><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">stack&lt;int&gt; st;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">for(int i=0;i&lt;n;i++){</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  while(!st.empty() &amp;&amp; a[i]&gt;a[st.top()]){ ng[st.top()]=___; st.pop(); }</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">4</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  st.push(i);</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">5</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">}</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"p-analysis\"><span class=\"label\">▍解析：</span>答：<code>a[i]</code>（栈顶遇到更大值，其下一个更大元素就是 a[i]）。</div></div><div class=\"problem\"><div class=\"p-head\"><span class=\"lvl mid\">中档</span><span class=\"p-title\">补全：双指针（两数之和）</span></div><div class=\"p-body\"><p>有序数组找和为 x 的一对。</p><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">int i=0,j=n-1;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">while(i&lt;j){</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  if(a[i]+a[j]==x){ i++; j--; }</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">4</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  else if(a[i]+a[j]&lt;x) ___;   // 答：i++</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">5</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  else j--;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">6</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">}</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"p-analysis\"><span class=\"label\">▍解析：</span>答：<code>i++</code>（和偏小则左指针右移增大）。</div></div><div class=\"problem\"><div class=\"p-head\"><span class=\"lvl hard\">压轴</span><span class=\"p-title\">补全：快速排序 partition 归位</span></div><div class=\"p-body\"><p>基准归位到分界点。</p><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">int p=arr[l], i=l, j=r;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">while(i&lt;j){ while(i&lt;j&amp;&amp;arr[j]&gt;=p)j--; while(i&lt;j&amp;&amp;arr[i]&lt;=p)i++; swap(arr[i],arr[j]); }</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">swap(arr[l], ___); return i;   // 答：arr[i]</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"p-analysis\"><span class=\"label\">▍解析：</span>答：<code>arr[i]</code>（把基准换到最终分界位置 i，返回 i 继续划分）。</div></div><div class=\"problem\"><div class=\"p-head\"><span class=\"lvl mid\">中档</span><span class=\"p-title\">补全：拓扑排序入队</span></div><div class=\"p-body\"><p>Kahn 算法。</p><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">for(int i=1;i&lt;=n;i++) if(ind[i]==0) q.push(i);</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">while(!q.empty()){</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  int u=q.front(); q.pop();</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">4</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  for(int v:g[u]) if(--ind[v]==0) ___;   // 答：q.push(v)</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">5</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">}</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"p-analysis\"><span class=\"label\">▍解析：</span>答：<code>q.push(v)</code>（入度降为 0 才可进入拓扑序）。</div></div><div class=\"problem\"><div class=\"p-head\"><span class=\"lvl hard\">压轴</span><span class=\"p-title\">补全：记忆化搜索</span></div><div class=\"p-body\"><p>避免重复计算。</p><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">int f(int n){</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  if(n&lt;=1) return n;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  if(dp[n]!=-1) return dp[n];</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">4</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  return dp[n]=___;   // 答：f(n-1)+f(n-2)</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">5</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">}</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"p-analysis\"><span class=\"label\">▍解析：</span>答：<code>f(n-1)+f(n-2)</code>（先查缓存，未算则递归并存入）。</div></div><div class=\"problem\"><div class=\"p-head\"><span class=\"lvl mid\">中档</span><span class=\"p-title\">补全：埃氏筛标记合数</span></div><div class=\"p-body\"><p>筛出素数。</p><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">for(int i=2;i*i&lt;=n;i++)</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  if(!is[i])</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">    for(int j=i*i;j&lt;=n;j+=i) ___;   // 答：is[j]=1</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"p-analysis\"><span class=\"label\">▍解析：</span>答：<code>is[j]=1</code>（从 i² 起标记 i 的倍数为合数）。</div></div><div class=\"problem\"><div class=\"p-head\"><span class=\"lvl mid\">中档</span><span class=\"p-title\">补全：二分答案（最小可行）</span></div><div class=\"p-body\"><p>求最小可行解。</p><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">while(l&lt;r){</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  int m=(l+r)/2;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  if(check(m)) r=m;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">4</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  else ___;   // 答：l=m+1</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">5</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">}</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">6</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">return l;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"p-analysis\"><span class=\"label\">▍解析：</span>答：<code>l=m+1</code>（check 不成立说明 m 太小，左界右移）。</div></div><div class=\"problem\"><div class=\"p-head\"><span class=\"lvl basic\">基础</span><span class=\"p-title\">补全：统计数字字符个数</span></div><div class=\"p-body\"><p>字符串遍历。</p><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">string s; cin&gt;&gt;s; int c=0;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">for(int i=0;i&lt;s.length();i++)</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  if(s[i]&gt;=&#039;0&#039; &amp;&amp; s[i]&lt;=&#039;9&#039;) ___;   // 答：c++</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">4</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">cout&lt;&lt;c;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"p-analysis\"><span class=\"label\">▍解析：</span>答：<code>c++</code>（满足条件则计数，注意字符字面量用单引号）。</div></div><div class=\"problem\"><div class=\"p-head\"><span class=\"lvl hard\">压轴</span><span class=\"p-title\">补全：滑动窗口定长最大和</span></div><div class=\"p-body\"><p>窗口长度 k。</p><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">int sum=0, mx=0;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">for(int i=0;i&lt;n;i++){</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  sum+=a[i];</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">4</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  if(i&gt;=k) sum-=a[i-k];</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">5</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  mx=max(mx, ___);   // 答：sum</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">6</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">}</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"p-analysis\"><span class=\"label\">▍解析：</span>答：<code>sum</code>（维护窗口和，实时更新最大值）。</div></div><div class=\"problem\"><div class=\"p-head\"><span class=\"lvl mid\">中档</span><span class=\"p-title\">补全：欧几里得求 gcd</span></div><div class=\"p-body\"><p>辗转相除。</p><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">int g(int a,int b){</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  while(b){ int t=a%b; a=b; ___; }   // 答：b=t</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  return a;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">4</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">}</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"p-analysis\"><span class=\"label\">▍解析：</span>答：<code>b=t</code>（每步用余数替换，直到 b 为 0）。</div></div>",
   "text": "中档 补全：前缀和递推 区间和 O(1) 查询。 C++ 复制 1 int s[N]={0}; 2 for(int i=1;i<=n;i++) s[i]=___; // 答：s[i-1]+a[i] 3 cout << s[r]-s[l-1]; ▍解析： 答： s[i-1]+a[i] （前缀和递推；区间和 = s[r]-s[l-1]）。 中档 补全：差分数组区间加 区间统一加 v。 C++ 复制 1 for(int i=1;i<=n;i++) d[i]=a[i]-a[i-1]; 2 d[l]+=v; ___; // 答：d[r+1]-=v 3 // 还原：a[i]=a[i-1]+d[i] ▍解析： 答： d[r+1]-=v （差分区间加只改两端，最后前缀和还原）。 压轴 补全：单调栈求下一个更大元素 Next Greater。 C++ 复制 1 stack<int> st; 2 for(int i=0;i<n;i++){ 3 while(!st.empty() && a[i]>a[st.top()]){ ng[st.top()]=___; st.pop(); } 4 st.push(i)"
